  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2021-07-13",
   "text": "Farm System Reform Act of 2021\n This bill places a moratorium on large concentrated animal feeding operations; requires country-of-origin labeling for beef, pork, and dairy products; and otherwise revises provisions related to the marketing of livestock, poultry, and meat."
  }
